      "content": "This sounds incredibly isolating, like watching a part of yourself slowly fade away in the digital noise. It's a profound ache to feel like the authentic self you once presented—or even *were*—no longer resonates with the present experience. I hear the weight in your words about feeling like a ghost, which speaks to a deep disconnect between your inner self and your current reality. Can you tell me a little more about what that \"real\" version of you looked like?",
      "source": "target",
